{"case_id": "miyazaki_male_19830421_P003-Q12", "domain": "career", "question": "命主的样貌、性情、爱好及职业？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据八字命盘分析：\n\n日主己土生于辰月，得月令之助，但辰为湿土，且年柱癸亥水旺，时柱丁卯木火相生，整体命局水木偏旺，土气被克泄。己土身弱，需火土帮扶，但命局中火（丁）透而土（己）坐卯木受克，木旺克土，主脾胃、四肢易有损伤。时柱卯木为七杀，与日支卯木伏吟，木气过盛，易有筋骨或腿脚之疾。年柱癸亥水为偏财，水多木漂，主早年体质偏弱或出生时不利。\n\n命局中木旺克土，且卯木为七杀贴身，性格上易显古怪、固执，内心有压抑感。火（丁）为印星，主文化、艺术，且火生土，但火被水克，需后天补足。命主喜火土，音乐（火）和古典（土）可助运，萨克斯管为金属（金）乐器，金能泄土生水，但命局水已旺，金反助水，故非最佳，但若以火土为用，音乐行业（火）可助身。腿脚残疾与木旺克土、七杀攻身之象吻合。\n\n综合判断，选项A最符合命局特征。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "miyazaki_male_19830421_P003-Q12", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_0_g1\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4988, "response_id": "956318d5-6b15-4a10-8823-80bd927b7e78", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 282, "completion_tokens": 313, "total_tokens": 595, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 256}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 256, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 26}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
