{"case_id": "miyazaki_male_19830421_P003-Q14", "domain": "relationship", "question": "命主的婚恋和子女情况？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：年柱癸亥，月柱丙辰，日柱己卯，时柱丁卯。日主为己土，生于辰月，得月令之助，但地支两卯木克土，天干丙丁火生土，整体身偏弱但印星有力。男命以正财为妻星，八字中财星癸水透于年干，但被月干丙火合克，且日支卯木为七杀，婚姻宫坐杀，主婚恋中易有压力或波折。时柱丁卯，卯木为七杀，子女宫坐杀，子女缘不弱但需看大运流年引动。\n\n大运方面，命主早年行乙卯、甲寅等木旺运，木克土加重，感情上多不稳定。2011年（辛卯年），辛金食神透出，卯木为七杀，流年与日支伏吟，且辛金可制杀，此年有婚恋机会，但卯木加重七杀，可能为经人介绍或非自由恋爱。2014年（甲午年），甲木正官合日主，午火生土，且午为桃花，此年生育可能性大，且午火为印星，利于子女。\n\n综合判断，命主婚恋有波折但非无婚，2011年成婚，2014年得女，符合A选项描述。B中“奉子成婚”八字无明确显示，且2012年（壬辰）辰土与月柱伏吟，但子女星不显；C、D与八字中婚恋迹象不符。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "miyazaki_male_19830421_P003-Q14", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_0_g1\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4971, "response_id": "2df16e34-f13c-431c-80b9-a48d05d6db05", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 269, "completion_tokens": 361, "total_tokens": 630, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 256}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 256, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 13}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
