{"case_id": "singapore_male_19930408_P004-Q16", "domain": "family", "question": "命主儿时家庭情况？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据八字命盘分析，日主己土生于辰月，得月令之助，但年柱癸酉金水相生，时柱丙子火水相冲，月柱丙辰火土相生。日主己土虽得月令，但地支未土为根，整体身偏弱，喜火土帮扶。\n\n家庭情况看年柱（父母宫）与月柱（兄弟宫）。年柱癸酉，癸水偏财透干，酉金食神，财星在年干，代表父亲可能因财或异性缘而离家（偏财多主父亲或非正缘）。月柱丙辰，丙火正印透出，辰土为比劫库，印星代表母亲，但丙火坐辰土，火土相生，母亲有照顾家庭之象。时柱丙子，子水冲克月支辰土，且子水为财星，与日支未土相害，暗示家庭内部有变动或冲突。\n\n综合来看，年柱财星透出且坐食神，食神生财，财星无制，易有外情；月柱正印为母亲，但被时柱子水冲克，母亲虽在但可能身体或情绪受影响。整体格局显示父亲因财或情缘而疏离家庭，母亲则承担主要抚养责任，且母亲可能因压力或健康问题（印星受冲）而需更多照顾。这与选项A“父亲出轨，母亲照顾生活”最为吻合。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "singapore_male_19930408_P004-Q16", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_0_g1\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4988, "response_id": "619f5845-79b5-4f58-9f0d-e67e240a7884", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 228, "completion_tokens": 326, "total_tokens": 554, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 100}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
